1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,310
Welcome to the unit.

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:06,670
Just make it. B.

3
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:11,780
Millie and Susie are talking about making paper roses.

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:16,780
Work in pairs and talk about something you would like to make.

5
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:21,680
Use the conversation below as a model.

6
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:25,640
What are you going to do, Susie?

7
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:29,050
I'm going to make some paper roses.

8
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,890
That sounds fun!

9
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:33,150
What do you need to make them?

10
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:40,030
I need some coloured paper, tape or glue and a pair of scissors.

11
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:44,110
Can I make paper roses with you? Sure!

12
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:50,910
You can fold the paper like this and I'll cut out the flower shapes.

13
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:56,410
Then we can tape or glue the pieces together. Great!

14
00:00:56,410 --> 00:01:01,500
When our job is complete, we'll see some lovely roses.
